== check q8_spawn.hero
error[mutable_parameter_as_value]: `bump` changes its argument `n` through `@`, and a function value cannot: no function type carries an `@` (§ 9), so `bump` is only called by name, its `n` marked `@` at the call
  at q8_spawn.hero:16:15
     |
  16 |     t = spawn(bump, x)  #~ thread_body
     |               ^^^^
  note: spec § 9: the `@` is written at the call too, so a call that changes an argument never looks like one that reads it, and a value called `f(x)` would hide it. To hand the work around as a value, write a function without `@` that returns the new value — `function next(n: i64) -> i64` — and assign what it returns

error[lent_parameter_as_value]: `get` reads its argument `c` in place through `lent`, and a function value cannot: no function type carries `lent` (§ 9), so `get` is only called by name
  at q8_spawn.hero:17:15
     |
  17 |     u = spawn(get, Cfg(n: 4))  #~ thread_body
     |               ^^^
  note: to hand the work around as a value, write a function that takes `c` without `lent` and call the lending one inside it, where the value may be copied
check exit 1
